flowchart LR
  Employee[Employee creates goal (DRAFT)]
  Submit[Submit to Manager (SUBMITTED_TO_MANAGER)]
  Manager[Manager reviews]
  ManagerApprove[Manager APPROVE => MANAGER_APPROVED]
  ManagerReturn[Manager RETURN => RETURNED_FOR_REWORK]
  Forward[Manager FORWARD => SENT_TO_ADMIN]
  Admin[Admin reviews]
  AdminApprove[Admin APPROVE => ADMIN_APPROVED]
  HR[HR reviews if SENT_TO_HR]
  Complete[Completed => COMPLETED]

  Employee --> Submit
  Submit --> Manager
  Manager -->|approve| ManagerApprove
  Manager -->|return| ManagerReturn
  Manager -->|forward| Forward
  ManagerApprove --> Forward
  Forward --> Admin
  Admin -->|approve| AdminApprove
  AdminApprove --> HR
  HR -->|approve| Complete
  ManagerReturn --> Employee
